window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-151f5fc48105","messages":[{"id":"RP-III-0109787","time":"2026-05-29T18:26:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":" 아도니스는 오늘도 어김없이 고민 중이다.   등 뒤 척추에서 묵직한 따가움이 감돌고 토기가 쇄골 중심에서 울렁거린다.\n 그리고...\n\n '얘, 꼬마야 괜찮니?'\n '야, 아까 나 치고간 거 사과해!'\n '갸악 살려주세요. ㅅㅂ 착하게 살게요!'\n '배고프다.'\n '엣헴-! 이 람-제이 공이 가고 있으니 어서 공물을 바치거라!'\n '저 테이블의 나이테...! 우리 외삼촌의 것 같은데...?'\n\n 한껏 예민해진 신경을 타고 머리통에 처박혀오는, 자연의 소리가 들린다.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109788","time":"2026-05-29T18:27:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"사실, 그 자체는 문제가 되지 않았다. 평소에도 쉽게 들을 수 있는 것들이다. 다만, 요새는 그러한 것들이 물에 빠졌다가 건져올린듯, 귀를 막다가 때기를 반복하듯이.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109789","time":"2026-05-29T18:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109790","time":"2026-05-29T18:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109791","time":"2026-05-29T18:28:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109792","time":"2026-05-29T18:29:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":" '머리 아파.'\n\n 아도니스의 신경을 건드리는 것이다.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109793","time":"2026-05-29T18:29:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":" '조용히 좀 해...'","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109794","time":"2026-05-29T18:30:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109795","time":"2026-05-29T18:30:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109796","time":"2026-05-29T18:30:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109797","time":"2026-05-29T18:31:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"잠깐, 잠깐만 기다려 봐? 이거 맞아? 이거 맞냐고? 조용히 하라고 진짜 조용해지기 있기없기?","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109798","time":"2026-05-29T18:31:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"아니, 아니지.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109799","time":"2026-05-29T18:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"내가 지금, 안들리고 있는건가?","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109800","time":"2026-05-29T18:32:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"지*말라지. 아, 아!","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109801","time":"2026-05-29T18:34:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"오뉴월이라 그런가? 몸에 땀이 차오른다. 이상하다, 이이상하다아.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109802","time":"2026-05-29T18:35:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"아도니스는벽을붙잡았다. 땀으로흥건해진손에미끌린다. 조용하다. 조용하다. 너무조용한데이런거이상한데이러면안되는거아닌가이러면안될텐데아아아아아아아.","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109803","time":"2026-05-29T18:36:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"지금, 지금 해가 떠있나? 안 보인다. 벽에 가려졌어. 이거 바닥인가? 창문이, 창문이?","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109804","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109805","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"...","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109806","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이래서 나는 대체 뭐지?","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109807","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"여긴 대체 뭐야?","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109808","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"무서워... 보고 싶어....","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109809","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"아도니스","profile":"올리브","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-6eeed2b4661f"]},{"id":"RP-III-0109810","time":"2026-05-29T18:37:00+09:00","room":"RP III","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"...good for you.","characters":[]}]};
